msgid "Privacy Settings"
msgstr "Privaatruum-Instellen"

#: privacy.cpp:74
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beschrieven"

#: privacy.cpp:82
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allgemeen"

#: privacy.cpp:83
msgid "Web Browsing"
msgstr "Dat Nett dörkieken"

#: privacy.cpp:89
msgid "Run Command History"
msgstr "Bruukte Befehlen"

#: privacy.cpp:91
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookies"

#: privacy.cpp:93
msgid "Saved Clipboard Contents"
msgstr "Sekert Twischenaflaag-Inholt"

#: privacy.cpp:95
msgid "Web History"
msgstr "Nett-Vörgeschicht"

#: privacy.cpp:97
msgid "Web Cache"
msgstr "Nett-Twischenspieker"

#: privacy.cpp:99
msgid "Form Completion Entries"
msgstr "Indrääg to't Kumpletteren vun Formuloren"

#: privacy.cpp:101
msgid "Recent Documents"
msgstr "Annerletzt bruukte Dokmenten"

#: privacy.cpp:103
msgid "Quick Start Menu"
msgstr "Fixstart-Menü"

#: privacy.cpp:105
msgid "Favorite Icons"
msgstr "Sieden-Lüttbiller"

#: privacy.cpp:107
msgid ""
"Check all cleanup actions you would like to perform. These will be executed "
"by pressing the button below"
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer all Oprümens-Aktschonen, de du utföhren wullt. De warrt denn "
"utföhrt, wenn du op den Knoop nerrn klickst"

#: privacy.cpp:108
msgid "Immediately performs the cleanup actions selected above"
msgstr "De baven utsöchten Aktschonen warrt fuurts dörföhrt"

#: privacy.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Clears the history of commands run through the Run Command tool on the "
"desktop"
msgstr ""
"Löscht de List vun Befehlen, de in den \"Befehl utföhren\"-Dialoog vun'n "
"Schrievdisch ingeven worrn sünd"

#: privacy.cpp:111
msgid "Clears all stored cookies set by websites"
msgstr "Löscht all Cookies, de vun Nettsieden sett worrn sünd"

#: privacy.cpp:112
msgid "Clears the history of visited websites"
msgstr "Löscht de List vun besöchte Nettsieden"

#: privacy.cpp:113
msgid "Clears the clipboard contents stored by Klipper"
msgstr "Löscht den Twischenaflaag-Inholt vun Klipper"

#: privacy.cpp:114
msgid "Clears the temporary cache of websites visited"
msgstr "Löscht den Twischenspieker vun besöchte Nettsieden"

#: privacy.cpp:115
msgid "Clears values which were entered into forms on websites"
msgstr "Löscht de Weerten, de in Formuloren op Nettsieden ingeven wöörn"

#: privacy.cpp:116
msgid "Clears the list of recently used documents from the KDE applications menu"
msgstr ""
"Löscht de List vun annerletzt bruukte Dokmenten in't KDE-Programmmenü (K "
"Menu)"

#: privacy.cpp:117
msgid "Clears the entries from the list of recently started applications"
msgstr "Löscht de List vun Programmen, de annerletzt start wöörn"

#: privacy.cpp:118
msgid "Clears the FavIcons cached from visited websites"
msgstr "Löscht all Sieden-Lüttbiller vun besöchte Nettsieden"

#: privacy.cpp:250
msgid "You are deleting data that is potentially valuable to you. Are you sure?"
msgstr "Du wullt Daten löschen, de villicht doch wertvull sünd. Büst seker?"

#: privacy.cpp:253
msgid "Starting cleanup..."
msgstr "Oprümen fangt an..."

#: privacy.cpp:262
msgid "Clearing %1..."
msgstr "%1 warrt löscht..."

#: privacy.cpp:294
msgid "Clearing of %1 failed"
msgstr "Dat Löschen vun %1 is fehlslaan"

#: privacy.cpp:301
msgid "Clean up finished."
msgstr "Oprümen is beennt."

#: privacy.cpp:308
msgid ""
"The privacy module allows a user to erase traces which KDE leaves on the "
"system, such as command histories or browser caches."
msgstr ""
"Mit dat Privaatruum-Moduul kann en Bruker de Spöör löschen, de KDE op't "
"Systeem lett, t.B. Listen vun bruukte Befehlen oder "
"Nettkieker-Twischenspieker."

#: rc.cpp:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Privaatruum"

#: rc.cpp:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select None"
msgstr "Nix utsöken"

#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clean Up"
msgstr "Oprümen"

#: rc.cpp:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network privacy level:"
msgstr "Privaatruum-Stoop för't Nettwark:"

#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Siet"

#: rc.cpp:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Middel"

#: rc.cpp:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "High"
msgstr "Hooch"

#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Egen"

#: rc.cpp:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Financial Information"
msgstr "Finanz-Informatschoon"

#: rc.cpp:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn me when I visit a site that uses my financial or purchase information:"
msgstr ""
"Wohrschoo mi wenn ik en Nettsiet besöök, de mien Finanz- oder "
"Kööpsinformatschonen bruken will:"

#: rc.cpp:27 rc.cpp:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "For marketing or advertising purposes"
msgstr "För Vermarktens- oder Warvens-Grünnen"

#: rc.cpp:29 rc.cpp:37 rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "To share with other companies"
msgstr "Tosamen mit annere Bedrieven bruken"

#: rc.cpp:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "Health Information"
msgstr "Sundheits-Informatschoon"

#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn me when I visit a site that uses my health or medical information: "
msgstr ""
"Wohrschoo mi wenn ik en Siet besöök, de mien Sundheits- oder medizinsche "
"Informatschonen bruken will: "

#: rc.cpp:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "Demographics"
msgstr "Demografie"

#: rc.cpp:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that uses my non-personally identifiable "
"information:"
msgstr ""
"Wohrschoo mi wenn ik'n Siet besöök, de Informatschonen bruken will, de "
"nich mi persöönlich totoornen sünd:"

#: rc.cpp:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "To determine my interests, habits or general behavior"
msgstr "To't Faststellen vun Interessen, Wahnen oder allgemeen Verhollen"

#: rc.cpp:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that shares my personal information with other "
"companies"
msgstr ""
"Wohrschoo mi wenn ik en Siet besöök, de mien persöönliche "
"Informatschonen mit annere Bedrieven deelt"

#: rc.cpp:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that does not let me know what information they "
"have about me"
msgstr ""
"Wohrschoo mi wenn ik en Siet besöök, vun de de Eegner mi nich weten laten "
"will, wat he över mi weet"

#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Personal Information"
msgstr "Persöönliche Informatschoon"

#: rc.cpp:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Warn me when I visit a site that may contact me about other products or "
"services:"
msgstr ""
"Wohrschoo mi wenn ik en Siet besöök, de mi villicht wegen annere Produkten "
"kontakteert:"

#: rc.cpp:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn me when I visit a site that may use my personal information to:"
msgstr ""
"Wohrschoo mi wenn ik en Siet besöök, de mien persöönliche "
"Informatschonen villicht bruukt, üm:"

#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Determine my habits, interests or general behavior"
msgstr "Mien Interessen, Wahnen oder allgemeen Verhollen fasttostellen"

#: rc.cpp:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Via telephone"
msgstr "Över't Telefon"

#: rc.cpp:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Via mail"
msgstr "Över Post"

#: rc.cpp:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Via email"
msgstr "Över Nettpost"

#: rc.cpp:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "And do not allow me to remove my contact information"
msgstr "Un nich verlöövt, de egen Kontaktdaten to löschen"
